s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105498.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-22T15:46:12Z"},"body":"This PR adds `{c,cpp}_compiler_launcher` options to enable the use of tools like `ccache` with Godot.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Needs `ccache` to be preinstalled and in the path\r\nscons c_compiler_launcher=ccache cpp_compiler_launcher=ccache\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command essentially prefixes `ccache` to every {`CC`,`CXX`} call.\r\n\r\nSee [`CMAKE_LANG_COMPILER_LAUNCHER`](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/variable/CMAKE_LANG_COMPILER_LAUNCHER.html#variable:CMAKE_%3CLANG%3E_COMPILER_LAUNCHER) for the inspiration.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105498/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105498/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}